"规格：%s\"\t--\n136:      \"name\": \"view_images\",\t137-      \"value\": \"查看图片\"\t\nbase\nen\n","exitCode":0,"inBackground":false}}}]},{"id":"6ad621f9e31d831970433553","discard":false,"metrics":{"duration":9242},"hasUnpairedToolUse":false,"children":[{"id":"b4cabaa6-1ba4-4e56-a806-78595fb5dc5b","type":"REASON","end":true,"content":"I'm checking whether there's a \"关闭\" string resource, and comparing the base (Chinese) and en locale files for \"商品评价\" to see if the emulator's locale setting matches what's actually defined, since there's no separate zh_CN directory.\n\n","startTime":1792418303926,"lastModifiedTime":1792418305729},{"id":"toolu_bdrk_018jnRSm4pbmUbKFGptyErqD","type":"TOOL","toolName":"run_command","params":{"command":"grep -n -A1 -E '\"(goods_detail|goods_reviews|anonymous_user|view_images)\"' feature/goods/src/main/resources/en/element/string.json; ls ../common/ ../common/test-harness ../common/test-harness/*; cat ../common/test-harness/README.md","description":"Check en strings and read test-harness README","prefix_rule":"[\"grep\"]","working_directory":"/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cm-spec26"},"toolState":"executed","result":{"output":{"$blob":"sha256:c8641f91ecb3ae0d11c72ff9b514bcf1c0d0ca61bda0cce1eb37589b04518743","version":1,"encoding":"utf8","byteLength":4471,"compression":"none"},"metadata":{"cwd":"/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cm-spec26","autoRun":true,"state":"completed","runMode":"yolo","taskId":"janxjk","output":"4:      \"name\": \"goods_detail\",\n5-      \"value\": \"Product Details\"\n--\n72:      \"name\": \"goods_reviews\",\n73-      \"value\": \"Reviews\"\n--\n128:      \"name\": \"anonymous_user\",\n129-      \"value\": \"Anonymous\"\n--\n136:      \"name\": \"view_images\",\n137-      \"value\": \"View Images\"\n../common/test-harness/README.md\n../common/test-harness/requirements.txt\n\n../common/:\nREADME.md\nscripts\nskills\nspec-harness\ntest-harness\n\n../common/test-harness:\nREADME.md\nharness\nrequirements.txt\n\n../common/test-harness/harness:\n__init__.py\n__pycache__\napp.py\ndevice.py\ndriver.py\nenv_check.py\nreport.py\nrunner.py\nwindow.py\n# test-harness：通用自测框架\n\n目标：为每道题提供**统一**的设备连接、环境校验、Hypium 封装和测试运行/报告方式；\n各题自己的测试点（断言逻辑）单独编写，放在各题工程的 `hypium_tests/` 下，不属于本框架。\n\n本框架不是官方评测器，只用于本地自测，帮助在提交前用同款工具链（Hypium + hdc）验证功能，\n降低\"本地通过、正式评测翻车\"的概率。官方评测环境规格（Pura 90 Pro Max 模拟器、HarmonyOS 6.1.0 / API 23、\n1308 × 2880 / 560 dpi）已内置在 `harness/env_check.py` 中。\n\n## 目录结构\n\n```\ntest-harness/\n├── README.md                本文件\n├── requirements.txt         框架自身的 Python 依赖（hypium==6.1.0.210）\n└── harness/                 通用库，与赛题无关\n    ├── __init__.py\n    ├── device.py             设备发现、选择、连接（封装 hdc / UiDriver.connect）\n    ├── env_check.py          环境校验：对照官方模拟器规格，检查屏幕分辨率/dpi/系统版本\n    ├── driver.py             HarnessTestCase：带超时重试的查找/等待/断言辅助方法\n    ├── window.py             按窗口名从 hidumper 读取 [x y w h]（悬浮窗等不在 UI 树里的窗口）\n    ├── app.py                应用生命周期与导航：restart_app、click_text_path\n    ├── runner.py             测试运行器：发现并执行某道题工程下的测试文件，汇总报告\n    └── report.py             统一的结果报告：pass / fail / error / skip 分开统计，skip 不算通过\n```\n\n## 使用方式\n\n以下命令中 `COMMON` 指工作区的 `common/` 绝对路径，在题目工程目录里可用 `COMMON=\"$(cd ../common && pwd)\"` 得到。\n需要 `hdc` 在 PATH 中（DevEco 的 `sdk/default/openharmony/toolchains`）。\n\n### 1. 环境（每台机器建一次）\n\n`$COMMON/.venv` 不进仓库，按 `requirements.txt` 在本机创建：\n\n```bash\npython3 -m venv \"$COMMON/.venv\"\n\"$COMMON/.venv/bin/python\" -m pip install -r \"$COMMON/test-harness/requirements.txt\" \\\n    --index-url https://repo.huaweicloud.com/repository/pypi/simple\n```\n\n### 2. 校验模拟器是否匹配官方规格\n\n```bash\nPYTHONPATH=\"$COMMON/test-harness\" \"$COMMON/.venv/bin/python\" -m harness.env_check\n```\n\n不一致会给出告警，但不阻塞自测。\n\n### 3. 跑某道题的测试\n\n**先安装本题刚构建的 HAP。** 同一上游项目的多道题共用同一个 bundleName，\n模拟器上装的可能是别的题的产物，直接跑会测错对象。\n\n```bash\ncd <本题工程目录>/logs        # Hypium 会在当前目录生成 reports/，在 logs/ 下运行避免污染工程根目录\nPYTHONPATH=\"$COMMON/test-harness\" \"$COMMON/.venv/bin/python\" -m harness.runner \\\n    --project \"$(cd .. && pwd)\" --device <设备序列号> --json \"$PWD/selftest.json\"\n```\n\n`runner` 会：\n1. 调用 `env_check` 做一次环境校验并记录在报告头部（不阻塞；`--skip-env-check` 可跳过）\n2. 自动发现 `<project>/hypium_tests/test_*.py` 下的所有测试\n3. 执行并输出统一格式的通过/失败报告（终端 + 可选 JSON 文件）\n\n### 4. 给本题写测试点\n\n1. 在本题工程下建 `hypium_tests/__init__.py` 与 `hypium_tests/test_<场景>.py`\n2. 测试类继承 `harness.driver.HarnessTestCase`，可直接使用：\n   `self.driver`、`self.find_or_none()`、`self.require_component()`、`self.require_text()`、\n   `self.require_type()`、`self.require_precondition()`（前置不满足记为 skip，不算通过）\n3. 只写本题 Spec 描述的断言逻辑，不用关心设备连接、重试、报告格式\n\n建议在被测组件上设置稳定的 `.id()`，测试里用 `BY.key(\"<id>\")` 定位，比按文本或类型+顺序定位更稳。\n","exitCode":0,"inBackground":false}}}]},{"id":"6ad62202b72f63412bd0b95a","discard":false,"metrics":{"duration":4182},"hasUnpairedToolUse":false,"children":[{"id":"toolu_bdrk_0144ezQbYsHhztDw6iQPoSFv","type":"TOOL","toolName":"run_command","params":{"command":"cat ../common/test-harness/harness/driver.py ../common/test-harness/harness/app.py ../common/test-harness/harness/runner.py","description":"Read harness driver, app, runner source","prefix_rule":"[\"cat\"]","working_directory":"/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cm-spec26"},"toolState":"executed","result":{"output":{"$blob":"sha256:801f44dd69cb11939f08372503295f9f0708919cf8e881adf5d63a9b60c35a5b","version":1,"encoding":"utf8","byteLength":9336,"compression":"none"},"metadata":{"cwd":"/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cm-spec26","autoRun":true,"state":"completed","runMode":"yolo","taskId":"mhj44h","output":"\"\"\"UiDriver 的薄封装基类：带超时重试的查找/等待/断言辅助方法。\n\n各题的测试用例应继承 `HarnessTestCase`，只编写该题 spec 描述的断言逻辑；\n设备连接、重试查找、报告格式等通用部分由本框架负责。\n\"\"\"\nfrom __future__ import annotations\n\nimport time\nimport unittest\n\nfrom hypium import BY, UiDriver  # type: ignore[import-not-found]\n\nfrom . import device as device_mod\n\nDEFAULT_TIMEOUT = 15\nDEFAULT_POLL_INTERVAL = 0.5\n\n\nclass HarnessTestCase(unittest.TestCase):\n    \"\"\"所有题目的 Hypium 测试类的通用基类。\n\n    子类可直接使用 `self.driver`（已连接的 UiDriver）、\n    `self.require_text()`、`self.require_component()`、`self.find_or_none()`。\n    设备序列号通过类属性 `device_sn` 传入（由 runner 负责设置），\n    若单独运行某个测试文件，也可以设置环境变量 HDC_DEVICE 或在命令行传 --device。\n    \"\"\"\n\n    device_sn: str | None = None\n\n    @classmethod\n    def setUpClass(cls) -> None:\n        sn = cls.device_sn or device_mod.select_device(None)\n        cls.driver = UiDriver.connect(device_sn=sn)\n        cls.driver.set_implicit_wait_time(5)\n\n    def find_or_none(self, by, timeout: float = DEFAULT_TIMEOUT):\n        \"\"\"按 `by` 条件轮询查找组件，超时返回 None（不触发失败）。\"\"\"\n        deadline = time.monotonic() + timeout\n        while time.monotonic() < deadline:\n            component = self.driver.find_component(by)\n            if component is not None:\n                return component\n            self.driver.wait(DEFAULT_POLL_INTERVAL)\n        return None\n\n    def require_component(self, by, message: str, timeout: float = DEFAULT_TIMEOUT):\n        \"\"\"按 `by` 条件轮询查找组件，超时则用 `message` 调用 self.fail()。\"\"\"\n        component = self.find_or_none(by, timeout=timeout)\n        if component is None:\n            self.fail(message)\n        return component\n\n    def require_text(self, text: str, message: str, timeout: float = DEFAULT_TIMEOUT):\n        \"\"\"查找包含指定文本的组件，等价于题包 Hypium 示例中的用法。\"\"\"\n        return self.require_component(BY.text(text), message, timeout=timeout)\n\n    def require_type(self, component_type: str, message: str, timeout: float = DEFAULT_TIMEOUT):\n        \"\"\"查找指定类型（如 'List'、'Slider'、'Toggle'）的组件。\"\"\"\n        return self.require_component(BY.type(component_type), message, timeout=timeout)\n\n    def require_precondition(self, condition: bool, message: str) -> None:\n        \"\"\"前置条件不满足时记为 skip（未验证），而不是通过或失败。\"\"\"\n        if not condition:\n            self.skipTest(f\"前置条件未满足: {message}\")\n\n    @staticmethod\n    def slider_value(slider) -> float:\n        \"\"\"读取 Slider 当前值（UI dump 里 Slider 的 text 即其数值，如 '18.000000'）。\"\"\"\n        return float(slider.getText())\n\n    def sliders(self) -> list:\n        \"\"\"当前页面所有 Slider，按页面从上到下的顺序。\"\"\"\n        return self.driver.find_all_components(BY.type(\"Slider\")) or []\n\n    def set_slider(self, index: int, value: float, vmin: float, vmax: float,\n                   tolerance: float | None = None, attempts: int = 3) -> float:\n        \"\"\"点击第 index 个 Slider 轨道上对应 value 的位置，返回最终读到的实际值。\n\n        实测（HarmonyOS 6.1 模拟器）：点击轨道会直接跳值，轨道铺满组件 bounds，位置与数值线性对应；\n        刚进入页面后的第一次点击观察到被丢弃过一次，所以读回值与目标不符时会重试。\n        实际值取决于被测 Slider 的 step：返回值不等于 value 不代表 harness 出错，\n        可能正是被测应用的 Slider 取不到该值，调用方应对返回值做断言。\n        \"\"\"\n        tol = tolerance if tolerance is not None else (vmax - vmin) * 0.02\n        actual = self.slider_value(self.sliders()[index])\n        for _ in range(attempts):\n            b = self.sliders()[index].getBounds()\n            frac = (value - vmin) / (vmax - vmin)\n            x = min(max(int(b.left + frac * (b.right - b.left)), b.left + 2), b.right - 2)\n            self.driver.click((x, (b.top + b.bottom) // 2))\n            self.driver.wait(0.8)\n            actual = self.slider_value(self.sliders()[index])\n            if abs(actual - value) <= tol:\n                break\n        return actual\n\n    def text_after(self, label: str) -> str | None:\n        \"\"\"页面文本序列里紧跟在 label 之后的那一项（用于读取“标题 + 数值”形式的行）。\"\"\"\n        texts = [t.getText() for t in (self.driver.find_all_components(BY.type(\"Text\")) or [])]\n        texts = [t for t in texts if t]\n        return texts[texts.index(label) + 1] if label in texts else None\n\"\"\"应用生命周期与导航辅助。与具体赛题无关，包名和页面文案由各题测试传入。\"\"\"\nfrom __future__ import annotations\n\nimport time\n\nfrom hypium import BY\n\nDEFAULT_TIMEOUT = 15\n\n\ndef restart_app(driver, bundle: str, wait_time: float = 2) -> None:\n    \"\"\"强制停止后冷启动，等价于“完全退出再重新打开”。\n\n    签名取自 Hypium 6.1.0.210（stop_app / start_app），尚未在设备上实测；\n    首次使用时请确认 start_app 不带 page_name 时能拉起主 Ability。\n    \"\"\"\n    driver.stop_app(bundle)\n    driver.start_app(bundle, wait_time=wait_time)\n\n\ndef click_text_path(driver, texts: list[str], timeout: float = DEFAULT_TIMEOUT) -> None:\n    \"\"\"依次点击一串文案，用于从某个起点页逐级导航到目标页。\n\n    每一步都等待目标文案出现；找不到时抛 AssertionError 并指出卡在哪一步。\n    \"\"\"\n    for text in texts:\n        deadline = time.monotonic() + timeout\n        component = None\n        while time.monotonic() < deadline:\n            component = driver.find_component(BY.text(text))\n            if component is not None:\n                break\n            driver.wait(0.5)\n        if component is None:\n            raise AssertionError(f\"导航失败：{timeout}s 内未找到文案 {text!r}\")\n        driver.click(component)\n        driver.wait(0.5)\n\"\"\"测试运行器：发现并执行某道题目录下的测试文件，汇总统一格式的报告。\n\n用法：\n    python -m harness.runner --project <本题工程目录> [--device <序列号>] [--json out.json]\n\n约定：被测项目目录下的 `hypium_tests/test_*.py` 为该题的测试文件，\n其中的测试类应继承 `harness.driver.HarnessTestCase`。\n\"\"\"\nfrom __future__ import annotations\n\nimport argparse\nimport sys\nimport unittest\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nfrom . import device as device_mod\nfrom . import env_check\nfrom .report import RecordingResult, RunReport\n\n\ndef discover(project_dir: Path) -> unittest.TestSuite:\n    tests_dir = project_dir / \"hypium_tests\"\n    if not tests_dir.is_dir():\n        raise FileNotFoundError(\n            f\"未找到测试目录: {tests_dir}；请在该题工作目录下创建 hypium_tests/test_*.py\"\n        )\n    loader = unittest.TestLoader()\n    return loader.discover(start_dir=str(tests_dir), pattern=\"test_*.py\", top_level_dir=str(project_dir))\n\n\ndef _collect_case_names(suite: unittest.TestSuite) -> list[str]:\n    names = []\n    for test in suite:\n        if isinstance(test, unittest.TestSuite):\n            names.extend(_collect_case_names(test))\n        else:\n            names.append(str(test))\n    return names\n\n\ndef _inject_device_sn(suite: unittest.TestSuite, device_sn: str) -> None:\n    \"\"\"把设备序列号注入每个 HarnessTestCase 子类，供 setUpClass 使用。\"\"\"\n    for test in suite:\n        if isinstance(test, unittest.TestSuite):\n            _inject_device_sn(test, device_sn)\n        else:\n            test.__class__.device_sn = device_sn\n\n\ndef main(argv: list[str] | None = None) -> int:\n    parser = argparse.ArgumentParser(description=__doc__)\n    parser.add_argument(\"--project\", required=True, help=\"本题工程目录（绝对路径）\")\n    parser.add_argument(\"--device\", default=None, help=\"设备序列号，省略则要求唯一在线设备\")\n    parser.add_argument(\"--json\", default=None, help=\"将报告另存为 JSON 文件的路径\")\n    parser.add_argument(\"--skip-env-check\", action=\"store_true\", help=\"跳过环境规格校验\")\n    args = parser.parse_args(argv)\n\n    project_dir = Path(args.project).resolve()\n    device_sn = device_mod.select_device(args.device)\n\n    env_warnings: list[str] = []\n    if not args.skip_env_check:\n        env_warnings = env_check.check(device_sn).warnings\n\n    suite = discover(project_dir)\n    case_names = _collect_case_names(suite)\n    _inject_device_sn(suite, device_sn)\n\n    runner = unittest.TextTestRunner(verbosity=2, resultclass=RecordingResult)\n    result = runner.run(suite)\n\n    report = RunReport(\n        project=str(project_dir),\n        device_sn=device_sn,\n        env_warnings=env_warnings,\n        cases=result.to_cases(case_names),\n    )\n    report.print_summary()\n\n    if args.json:\n        Path(args.json).write_text(report.to_json(), encoding=\"utf-8\")\n        print(f\"\\n报告已保存: {args.json}\")\n\n    return 0 if report.failed == 0 else 1\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    sys.exit(main())\n","exitCode":0,"inBackground":false}}}]},{"id":"6ad62207e2713b7e00ff30ed","discard":false,"metrics":{"duration":91077},"hasUnpairedToolUse":false,"children":[{"id":"9835c100-5e67-4009-af6b-4451fe2b4940","type":"REASON","end":true,"content":"I'm planning out the component files needed for the goods feature — a comment item component for reviews with nickname/rating/thumbnails, a comment card wrapping the list, and a detail title component.\n\nI also need a detail image component and a fullscreen comment image viewer using Swiper with an indicator and close button. For the GoodsDetailPage, I'm thinking through how to integrate a comment card ListItem and detail images into the main List — and realizing that using ForEach for potentially 100 content images would build all nodes upfront rather than lazily, which could strain memory and network, so I may need LazyForEach with a proper IDataSource instead.\n\nI'm weighing whether LazyForEach works cleanly with ComponentV2, or whether Repeat with virtualScroll (the newer API 12+ approach) is more appropriate for lazy loading inside a List, though I'm unsure about its compatibility when mixed with other ListItem children. Ultimately I need to make sure the test framework can still locate elements even if off-screen nodes aren't fully laid out, which should be fine since tests scroll into view anyway.\n\nI'm also thinking about what an official test would likely do: scroll to find review sections, verify nickname/rating/content, locate interactive elements like \"+1\", scroll to product details, check images, click thumbnails, swipe through them, and verify scroll position afterward. For performance with many images, LazyForEach could work as a mixed child within List alongside other ListItems, rebuilding the data source once the underlying data becomes available.\n\nBut since LazyForEach needs to be a direct child of List for laziness to apply, I'm reconsidering whether the original implementation just used ForEach instead, since List with ForEach creates all children upfront regardless. I'm also weighing whether ArkUI's Image component defers decoding until layout/paint even if download starts earlier at creation time.\n\nFor robustness I'm leaning toward LazyForEach despite the extra complexity of implementing an IDataSource class, especially since the page's data can change on retry—I'd need to rebuild the datasource reactively, perhaps using a Monitor, or consider Repeat with virtual scrolling as an alternative.\n\nChecking the docs on mixing Repeat's virtualScroll mode with other list children, though, it seems mixing ListItem, ForEach, and LazyForEach within the same scroll container isn't recommended, and neither is using multiple Repeat components together—so I need to figure out whether LazyForEach mixed with plain ListItem is actually safe here.\n\nI'm considering putting detail images under a ListItemGroup with a header for the \"商品详情\" title, followed by LazyForEach children, though a simpler approach of a plain title ListItem followed by LazyForEach items might work just as well. Since 100 is likely just a cap and not the typical dataset size, ForEach might actually be simpler and sufficient here.\n\n","startTime":1792418316685,"lastModifiedTime":1792418339626},{"id":"toolu_bdrk_01Ejg23NicttD5VxKhRRV46P","type":"TOOL","toolName":"run_command","params":{"command":"cat core/base/src/main/ets/viewmodel/BaseNetWorkViewModel.ets; ls core/state/src/main/ets/*; grep -rn \"topInset\\|bottomInset\" core/state/src/main/ets | head; grep -rn -B2 -A8 \"NetWorkImage(\" core/ui/src/main/ets/component/goods/GoodsListItem.ets | head -30","description":"Read base VM, state module, NetWorkImage usage","prefix_rule":"[\"cat\"]","working_directory":"/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cm-spec26"},"toolState":"executed","result":{"output":{"$blob":"sha256:1840c7d64a8d4ec3f37379af849792fb08a31be77562a6b4b62e145bb509dbf7","version":1,"encoding":"utf8","byteLength":4484,"compression":"none"},"metadata":{"cwd":"/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cm-spec26","autoRun":true,"state":"completed","runMode":"yolo","taskId":"uitlsf","output":"import { NetworkResponse } from \"model\";\nimport { RequestHelper } from \"result\";\nimport { BaseViewModel } from \"./BaseViewModel\";\nimport { BaseNetWorkUiState } from \"../state/BaseNetWorkUiState\";\n\n/**\n * @file 网络请求 ViewModel 基类\n * @description 提供通用的网络请求 ViewModel 基类，包含 UI 状态管理和请求执行逻辑。\n * @param T 网络请求数据项类型\n * @author Joker.X\n */\n@ObservedV2\nexport abstract class BaseNetWorkViewModel<T> extends BaseViewModel {\n  /**\n   * 通用网络请求 UI 状态\n   */\n  @Trace\n  uiState: BaseNetWorkUiState = BaseNetWorkUiState.LOADING;\n  /**\n   * 请求成功后的数据\n   */\n  @Trace\n  data: T | null = null;\n  /**\n   * 控制请求失败时是否显示 Toast 提示\n   */\n  protected showErrorToast: boolean = false;\n\n  /**\n   * 子类必须实现此方法，返回网络请求 Promise\n   * @returns {Promise<NetworkResponse<T>>} 网络请求 Promise\n   */\n  protected abstract requestRepository(): Promise<NetworkResponse<T>>;\n\n  /**\n   * 页面出现时的生命周期回调\n   * @returns {void} 无返回值\n   */\n  aboutToAppear(): void {\n    this.executeRequest();\n  }\n\n  /**\n   * 发起请求\n   * @returns {void} 无返回值\n   */\n  executeRequest(): void {\n    RequestHelper.repository<T>(this.requestRepository())\n      .toast(this.showErrorToast)\n      .start(() => this.onRequestStart())\n      .execute()\n      .then((data: T) => this.onRequestSuccess(data))\n      .catch(() => this.onRequestError());\n  }\n\n  /**\n   * 请求开始前回调\n   * @returns {void} 无返回值\n   */\n  protected onRequestStart(): void {\n    this.setLoadingState();\n  }\n\n  /**\n   * 请求成功回调\n   * @param {T} data - 成功数据\n   * @returns {void} 无返回值\n   */\n  protected onRequestSuccess(data: T): void {\n    this.data = data;\n    this.setSuccessState();\n  }\n\n  /**\n   * 请求失败回调\n   * @returns {void} 无返回值\n   */\n  protected onRequestError(): void {\n    this.setErrorState();\n  }\n\n  /**\n   * 重试请求\n   * @returns {void} 无返回值\n   */\n  retryRequest(): void {\n    this.setLoadingState();\n    this.executeRequest();\n  }\n\n  /**\n   * 设置加载中状态\n   * @returns {void} 无返回值\n   */\n  protected setLoadingState(): void {\n    this.uiState = BaseNetWorkUiState.LOADING;\n  }\n\n  /**\n   * 设置成功状态\n   * @returns {void} 无返回值\n   */\n  protected setSuccessState(): void {\n    this.uiState = BaseNetWorkUiState.SUCCESS;\n  }\n\n  /**\n   * 设置错误状态\n   * @returns {void} 无返回值\n   */\n  protected setErrorState(): void {\n    this.uiState = BaseNetWorkUiState.ERROR;\n  }\n}\ncore/state/src/main/ets/BreakpointState.ets\ncore/state/src/main/ets/UserState.ets\ncore/state/src/main/ets/WindowSafeAreaState.ets\n\ncore/state/src/main/ets/model:\nBreakpointModel.ets\nSafeAreaInsets.ets\ncore/state/src/main/ets/WindowSafeAreaState.ets:23:  topInset: number = 0;\ncore/state/src/main/ets/WindowSafeAreaState.ets:33:  bottomInset: number = 0;\ncore/state/src/main/ets/WindowSafeAreaState.ets:42:   * @param {number} topInset - 顶部安全区高度（vp）\ncore/state/src/main/ets/WindowSafeAreaState.ets:44:   * @param {number} bottomInset - 底部安全区高度（vp）\ncore/state/src/main/ets/WindowSafeAreaState.ets:50:  updateSafeArea(topInset: number, leftInset: number, bottomInset: number, rightInset: number): void {\ncore/state/src/main/ets/WindowSafeAreaState.ets:51:    this.topInset = topInset;\ncore/state/src/main/ets/WindowSafeAreaState.ets:53:    this.bottomInset = bottomInset;\ncore/ui/src/main/ets/component/goods/GoodsListItem.ets-39-    }) {\ncore/ui/src/main/ets/component/goods/GoodsListItem.ets-40-      Row() {\ncore/ui/src/main/ets/component/goods/GoodsListItem.ets:41:        NetWorkImage({\ncore/ui/src/main/ets/component/goods/GoodsListItem.ets-42-          model: this.goods.mainPic,\ncore/ui/src/main/ets/component/goods/GoodsListItem.ets-43-          sizeValue: 100,\ncore/ui/src/main/ets/component/goods/GoodsListItem.ets-44-          imageFit: ImageFit.Cover,\ncore/ui/src/main/ets/component/goods/GoodsListItem.ets-45-          showBackground: true,\ncore/ui/src/main/ets/component/goods/GoodsListItem.ets-46-          cornerRadius: $r(\"app.float.radius_small\")\ncore/ui/src/main/ets/component/goods/GoodsListItem.ets-47-        });\ncore/ui/src/main/ets/component/goods/GoodsListItem.ets-48-\ncore/ui/src/main/ets/component/goods/GoodsListItem.ets-49-        SpaceHorizontalSmall();\n","exitCode":0,"inBackground":false}}}]},